      "en": "from Mount Halak, that goes up to Seir, even to Baal Gad in the valley of Lebanon under Mount Hermon. He took all their kings, struck them, and put them to death.",
      "ko": "곧 세일로 올라가는 할락산에서부터 헤르몬산 아래 레바논 골짜기의 바알갓까지라 그 모든 왕을 잡아 쳐죽였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "7c0d9e0bac61427c1473759efe2d59f120666cfc3680f9238f57453ce362dc1b",
      "translation_text_hash": "2b92faa8e3f820e2cf708a843241b4939a919bd53c8c725d08607526fc91f7fd",
