      "en": "Joshua made war a long time with all those kings.",
      "ko": "여호수아가 그 모든 왕과 싸운지는 여러 날이라",
      "source_text_hash": "a50c912879d9d541cb8c0fb9e69c2109f96ddd57f9193a41657a517f5329b0c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "e2178da97b59107325d5af30b5d336ee81ba0997c299bdf4d90299e5811e0f39",
